  "qualification": "The index binds retained evidence by file fingerprints. The separate final delivery-integrity receipt verifies frozen native, source/test/build inputs, pinned originals and lossless archive/campaign transport. Cost closure follows the predeclared pooled eight-session rule; both cohort results, including the second-cohort overruns, remain retained. RSWP establishes three completed levels and scoped public trajectory equality, not a full-game win, strict private graph/proposal identity, new causal game capability, complete V5/V6 parity or long-session stability. Large source and campaign originals are preserved as checked ordered byte parts; raw CPU profiles also remain as lossless gzip."
}
